{"id":"ohnehin","lemma":"ohnehin","pos":"adv","rank":3551,"glosses":["in any case, anyway, either way","already (further exacerbating the existing situation)"],"ipa":"/oːnəˈhɪn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/De-ohnehin.ogg/De-ohnehin.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich wollte ohnehin mit dir reden.","en":"I wanted to talk to you anyway.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to talk"}]},{"text":"Es ist ohnehin zu spät.","en":"It's too late anyway.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Ich wollte ohnehin mit euch reden.","en":"I wanted to talk to you anyway.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"to talk"}]},{"text":"Ich habe nur gesagt, was ohnehin klar war.","en":"I was only stating the obvious.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"okay!"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Wir wollen ohnehin nicht wiederkommen.","en":"We don't want to come back anyway.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to return"}]}]}